@startuml
skinparam svgDimensionStyle false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox

actor "Provider" as pr
participant "Point of Service\n(e.g., EMR)" as p
participant "Consent\nManager" as c
database "EHR-1" as e1
database "EHR-n" as en
participant "IPS Holder\n(Content Creator)" as creator
participant "Receiving Provider\n(Content Consumer)" as consumer

pr -> c : Authenticate and\nestablish access authority
pr -> p : Query for patient's\nhealth data
p -> e1 : Query for patient's health data
e1 --> p : Query response
loop For each additional data source
p -> en : Query for patient's health data
en --> p : Query response
end
pr -> p : Curate relevant\nhealth content
p -> p : Create provider-mediated\nIPS document
p -> creator : Make IPS document available
note over creator : Any system that stores\nor handles the IPS\nuntil it is requested
creator <-> consumer : Document Sharing [PCC-1]\nIPS Document
@enduml
